# Interactive control states

Canonical doc: `docs/ui-rules/interactive-states.md`  
Shared classes: `packages/base-ui/src/lib/controlStates.ts`

## Required props (use primitives — do not hand-roll)

| Need | API |
|------|-----|
| Button async | `<Button loading={…}>` |
| Combobox fetch | `<Combobox isLoading={…}>` |
| Field error | `<FormField error={…}>` → forwards ring to child |
| Form errors | `<EntityForm errors={{ field: 'msg' }}>` |
| Dialog save | `<DialogFormFooter confirmLoading={…}>` |
| Confirmed valid | `valid` on `FormField` / input — **only** when explicitly verified |

## Bans

```
❌ Manual spinner + disabled on Button — use loading
❌ Error text without invalid ring on the control
❌ valid on every non-empty field
❌ hover styles on disabled controls
❌ Custom red border classes — use FormField / aria-invalid + controlStates
```

## Backend → frontend

Return field-keyed validation messages. Frontend maps to `EntityForm errors` — plain strings, not HTML.
